<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's producer price indices fall in Nov.</title>
<headline>Portugal's producer price indices fall in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Index of Producer Prices of Portugal's industry fell 0.4 percent to 120.9 in November 1996 compared with October, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>			     Nov 96  Oct 96  Nov 95</p>
<p>General Index	     120.9  121.3   116.9</p>
<p>Monthly variation     -0.4 pct 0.5 pct</p>
<p>Yr/yr variation	  3.4 pct 3.7 pct</p>
<p>Extractive industry     118.00 117.9   116.6</p>
<p>Textile industry	  117.1  117.1   117.6</p>
<p>BASE: 1993=100</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
